This list includes all [[special skill]]s that players can use but cannot [[skill#Learning and unlocking skills |learn]]. They are "static" and are not scalable with [[Title]] ranks or [[Attribute]]s.

They are usually provided by [[bundle]]s, NPCs, [[environmental effect]]s, environmental bundles and other skills. Once the conditions that grant them stop, they will not appear in the [[Skills and Attributes panel]] and will be lost and unavailable until the conditions are met again.

